- Follow the SAME style and pattern as the matched existing scenario
- Generate using Given / When / Then / And format
- Generate minimum 3 scenarios:
  → Happy Path (positive flow)
  → Negative Path (invalid/error flow)
  → Edge Case (boundary/unusual flow)
- Add appropriate tags:
  → @smoke — for critical happy path
  → @regression — for all scenarios
  → @functional — for business logic scenarios
  → @negative — for error/invalid scenarios

STEP 5 — FLAG NEW STEPS
- After generating scenarios, list any NEW step definitions needed
- Format them clearly so developer knows what to implement

